 "discovery_answer": "The egress answer is registered, and `nookku register` accepted it on the first try. Its output:\n\n```\nnookku: the egress answer is registered. The next start uses these parts:\n- model API anthropic: ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL -> the URL in ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL or the default (proxy)\n- MCP server catalog: http CATALOG_MCP_URL -> http://127.0.0.1:9310/mcp (proxy)\n- MCP server notes: stdio NOTES_MCP_COMMAND -> python3 notes_mcp.py (proxy)\n- database shop: postgres, DATABASE_URL (proxy)\n- database returns: sqlite, returns.db (driver trace)\nShow these parts to the tester. If they are correct, the tester types the prompt nookku start in the next 30 minutes. If a part is wrong, run nookku register again with the correct answer.\n```\n\nWhere each part comes from in `app.py`:\n- **Model API:** the Claude Agent SDK session with `model=\"haiku\"`. The app doesn't set a base URL, so the URL is `null`.\n- **catalog:** an HTTP MCP server. Its URL comes from `CATALOG_MCP_URL`, default `http://127.0.0.1:9310/mcp`.\n- **notes:** a stdio MCP server. The app reads its command line from `NOTES_MCP_COMMAND` and splits it into words. The notes server writes to `notes.json`, but that file is part of the server, so I didn't list it separately.\n- **shop:** Postgres. The app connects with the `postgres://` URL in `DATABASE_URL`, default `127.0.0.1:55432/shop`. The proxy records its calls, including the rows of each answer.\n- **returns:** the SQLite file `returns.db`, which the app opens directly with `sqlite3`. A driver trace records its calls.\n- There are no HTTP backends and no other parts like queues or mail.\n\n**Driver trace:** I didn't change any code. `app.py:45-69` already turns on the psycopg and sqlite3 OpenTelemetry instrumentations when `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` is set. They export over OTLP/HTTP using the standard `OTEL_*` variables and record the statement text by default. A driver trace doesn't include result rows and can hide parameter values. So for `returns.db` you'll see the SQL statements but not the data that comes back.\n\nPlease check these parts. If they're right, type `nookku start` within the next 30 minutes. If one is wrong, tell me and I'll correct the file and register it again.",
